{"update() in detector validator uses validated_data.get('detector_type', ...) but the serializer field is named 'type', so detector type updates will not take effect": 0.2989436686038971, "schedule_webhook_delivery runs as a scheduled task with no visible rate-limiting, which could overwhelm downstream services or the queue during bursts of webhooks": 0.07731729745864868, "drain_webhooks logic lacks strict idempotency controls or robust locking, which could lead to duplicate deliveries or skipped items across batches when processing concurrently": 0.04401301220059395, "BrowserReportingCollectorEndpoint is exposed without authentication/authorization (permission_classes = ()), allowing external clients to abuse it for DoS or probing backend behavior": 0.4848371744155884, "Bulk replay deletion API lacks per-user ownership controls - users with project write/admin rights could delete other users' replays since no owner_user_id or owner_team_id is enforced": 0.008387607522308826, "project_replay_summarize_breadcrumbs endpoint lacks explicit per-replay ownership check at the API boundary, potentially allowing cross-replay data exposure within an organization": 0.011769974604249, "make_seer_request in analyze_recording_segments uses requests.post without a timeout parameter, which can cause worker threads to block indefinitely": 0.5921981930732727, "chart.tsx accesses organization.features without guaranteeing organization is in scope, risking a runtime error": 0.03930066525936127, "When feature flag is enabled, TableWidgetVisualization is rendered with columns=[] and empty data, producing a blank table instead of the intended chart": 0.9959783554077148, "TableWidgetVisualization derives columnOrder from tableData.meta.fields when columns are not provided, which is brittle if tableData.meta.fields is missing or shaped differently": 0.8264815807342529, "Visualize class changed from yAxes array to single yAxis property, causing callers relying on multiple y-axes to silently lose data coverage": 0.8595658540725708}